Overview
At Lucky Made Apps, we prioritize your privacy. Ultra Minimal speedometer is designed with absolute privacy in mind. We do not collect, transmit, store, share, or process any personal or sensitive user data whatsoever.
Data Collection and Usage
No Personal Data Collected: The app does not ask for, collect, or store any personal identifiers, such as your name, email address, IP address, or device ID.
No Tracking or Analytics: The app contains no third-party tracking software, advertising networks, or usage analytics tools (such as Google Analytics or Firebase).
On-Device GPS Location: Ultra Minimal speedometer processes your location data exclusively on your device in real time solely to calculate and display your speed. This location data is processed locally, is never transmitted off your device, and is never saved or stored.
